00:58:20.030 --> 00:58:26.290
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who actually has his own philosophy for selling This American Life to new stations.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ的管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，他本人实际上有一套向新电台推销《美国生活》的哲学。

00:58:26.290 --> 00:58:29.750
<v Radio Ad Salesman>It doesn't matter what you say, it doesn't matter how vapid it is.
<v Radio Ad Salesman>你说什么并不重要，它有多无聊并不重要。

00:58:29.750 --> 00:58:35.870
<v Bob Kosberg>But the key line that sold it was to then say, "In other words, Mr. Executive, it's basically Jaws on paws."
<v Bob Kosberg>但卖掉它的关键台词是说：“换句话说，高管先生，这基本上就是装了爪子的《大白鲨》。”

00:58:35.870 --> 00:58:55.250
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:55.250 --> 00:59:00.250
